{
  "__inputs": [],
  "__requires": [
    {
      "type": "grafana",
      "id": "grafana",
      "name": "Grafana",
      "version": "11.5.0"
    },
    {
      "type": "datasource",
      "id": "prometheus",
      "name": "Prometheus",
      "version": "1.0.0"
    }
  ],
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "description": "LLM Inference Profiler — main observability dashboard. Built-in vLLM metrics live; per-stage / GPU / cost rows awaiting M2/M3/M4 exporters.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [

    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {"h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0},
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Built-in vLLM Metrics",
      "type": "row"
    },

    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {"unit": "s", "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"}},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 7, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 1},
      "id": 10,
      "options": {
        "legend": {"displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true},
        "tooltip": {"mode": "single"}
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum(rate(vllm:e2e_request_latency_seconds_bucket[1m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p50 E2E latency",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(vllm:e2e_request_latency_seconds_bucket[1m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p95 E2E latency",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum(rate(vllm:e2e_request_latency_seconds_bucket[1m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p99 E2E latency",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "title": "E2E Request Latency (vllm:e2e_request_latency_seconds)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },

    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {"unit": "s", "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"}},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 7, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 1},
      "id": 11,
      "options": {
        "legend": {"displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true},
        "tooltip": {"mode": "single"}
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum(rate(vllm:time_to_first_token_seconds_bucket[1m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p50 TTFT",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(vllm:time_to_first_token_seconds_bucket[1m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p95 TTFT",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Time to First Token (vllm:time_to_first_token_seconds)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },

    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {"unit": "s", "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"}},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 7, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 1},
      "id": 12,
      "options": {
        "legend": {"displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true},
        "tooltip": {"mode": "single"}
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum(rate(vllm:request_queue_time_seconds_bucket[1m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p50 queue time",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(vllm:request_queue_time_seconds_bucket[1m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p95 queue time",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Queue Wait Time (vllm:request_queue_time_seconds)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },

    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {"unit": "short", "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"}},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 7, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 8},
      "id": 13,
      "options": {
        "legend": {"displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true},
        "tooltip": {"mode": "single"}
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "expr": "vllm:num_requests_running",
          "legendFormat": "running",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "expr": "vllm:num_requests_waiting",
          "legendFormat": "waiting",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Active Requests (running / waiting)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },

    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {"unit": "percentunit", "min": 0, "max": 1, "color": {"mode": "thresholds"},
          "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [
            {"color": "green", "value": null},
            {"color": "yellow", "value": 0.7},
            {"color": "red", "value": 0.9}
          ]}},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 7, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 8},
      "id": 14,
      "options": {"reduceOptions": {"values": false, "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": ""}},
      "title": "KV Cache Usage (vllm:gpu_cache_usage_factor)",
      "type": "gauge",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "expr": "vllm:kv_cache_usage_perc",
          "legendFormat": "KV cache",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {"unit": "tps", "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"}},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 7, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 8},
      "id": 15,
      "options": {
        "legend": {"displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true},
        "tooltip": {"mode": "single"}
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "expr": "rate(vllm:prompt_tokens_total[1m])",
          "legendFormat": "prompt tok/s",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "expr": "rate(vllm:generation_tokens_total[1m])",
          "legendFormat": "generation tok/s",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Token Throughput (prompt & generation tok/s)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },

    {
      "collapsed": true,
      "gridPos": {"h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 15},
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Per-Stage Latency (M2 — awaiting profiler_exporter)",
      "type": "row",
      "panels": [
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "gridPos": {"h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 16},
          "id": 20,
          "options": {"mode": "markdown", "content": "## Per-Stage Latency — M2 Implementation\n\nThis row will be populated by the **profiler_exporter** (port 9101) once enabled by teammate M2.\n\nMetric feeding these panels:\n```\nllmprof_stage_latency_seconds{stage=\"tokenization\"}\nllmprof_stage_latency_seconds{stage=\"queue_wait\"}\nllmprof_stage_latency_seconds{stage=\"prefill\"}\nllmprof_stage_latency_seconds{stage=\"decode\"}\nllmprof_stage_latency_seconds{stage=\"detokenization\"}\nllmprof_stage_latency_seconds{stage=\"network\"}\nllmprof_stage_latency_seconds{stage=\"total\"}\nllmprof_request_total_seconds\nllmprof_tokens_in_total\nllmprof_tokens_out_total\n```\n\nTo enable: uncomment `profiler_exporter` in `docker/docker-compose.yml` and re-run `make up`."},
          "title": "",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "collapsed": true,
      "gridPos": {"h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 16},
      "id": 3,
      "title": "GPU Metrics (M3 — awaiting gpu_collector)",
      "type": "row",
      "panels": [
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "gridPos": {"h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 17},
          "id": 30,
          "options": {"mode": "markdown", "content": "## GPU Metrics — M3 Implementation\n\nThis row will be populated by the **gpu_collector** (port 9102) once enabled by teammate M3.\n\nMetrics feeding these panels:\n```\nllmprof_gpu_utilization_percent{gpu=\"0\"}\nllmprof_gpu_memory_used_bytes{gpu=\"0\"}\nllmprof_gpu_power_watts{gpu=\"0\"}\n```\n\nTo enable: uncomment `gpu_collector` in `docker/docker-compose.yml` and re-run `make up`."},
          "title": "",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "collapsed": true,
      "gridPos": {"h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 17},
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Memory Breakdown (M3 — awaiting gpu_collector)",
      "type": "row",
      "panels": [
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "gridPos": {"h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 18},
          "id": 40,
          "options": {"mode": "markdown", "content": "## Memory Breakdown — M3 Implementation\n\nMetric feeding these panels:\n```\nllmprof_memory_breakdown_bytes{component=\"weights\",phase=\"prefill\"}\nllmprof_memory_breakdown_bytes{component=\"kv_cache\",phase=\"decode\"}\nllmprof_memory_breakdown_bytes{component=\"activations\",phase=\"prefill\"}\n```"},
          "title": "",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "collapsed": true,
      "gridPos": {"h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 18},
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Cost per 1M Tokens (M4 — awaiting profiler_exporter)",
      "type": "row",
      "panels": [
        {
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "gridPos": {"h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 19},
          "id": 50,
          "options": {"mode": "markdown", "content": "## Cost per 1M Tokens — M4 Implementation\n\nMetric feeding this panel:\n```\nllmprof_cost_per_million_tokens_usd\n```\n\nCalculated in the analyzer using `gpu_price_per_hour_usd` from `config.yaml` divided by total output tokens in the observation window.\n\nTo enable: implement cost calculation in `llm_profiler/analyzer/` and expose via `profiler_exporter`."},
          "title": "",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }

  ],
  "refresh": "5s",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "tags": ["llm", "profiler", "vllm", "inference"],
  "templating": {"list": []},
  "time": {"from": "now-30m", "to": "now"},
  "timepicker": {},
  "timezone": "browser",
  "title": "LLM Inference Profiler",
  "uid": "llmprof-main",
  "version": 1
}
